502
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:20,520
[笑声]
[LAUGHTER]

503
00:27:20,560 --> 00:27:22,120
我就喜欢这股劲儿，听着真带劲。
好啦，女士们先生们，
I like that. I like the sound
of that. So there we are,
ladies and gentlemen,

