还有吉米·卡尔！
-非常感谢。
-David Walliams!
And Jimmy Carr!
-Thank you very much.

505
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:26,680
谢谢。
Thank you.

506
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:33,440
