And everywhere else,
I'm brilliant, frankly.

952
00:53:45,180 --> 00:53:47,700
你懂的，看了你只会惊呼：
“车里坐的绝对是雅克·维伦纽夫！
You know, you just sort of go,
"That is Jacques Villeneuve
in that car.

953
00:53:47,740 --> 00:53:50,420
“虽然胖了点，但绝对是维伦纽夫本尊。”
"A bit fatter, but that's
Jacques Villeneuve."

954
00:53:50,460 --> 00:53:54,540
眼看还有20秒的差距要追，
我请来了赛道教练，
With 20 seconds to make up,
I called on the
circuit instructor,

