who suggested I went back
to studying the game.

956
00:53:58,980 --> 00:54:02,580
- 我要按真跑赛道的方式来开。
- 好。
-I'm gonna drive this
like I'm driving the track.
-Okay.

957
00:54:02,620 --> 00:54:05,580
- 所以我在这儿刹车……
- 没错。
-So I'm braking there...
-Yeah.

958
00:54:05,620 --> 00:54:08,700
不对，你看，
游戏里的刹车可比现实好使多了。
No, you see,
the brakes are better
than it is here.

959
00:54:08,740 --> 00:54:10,780
- 现实中你根本做不到。
- 确实做不到。
-You can't do that in reality.
-No, you can't.

960
00:54:10,820 --> 00:54:13,140
而且你一路冲上来时
时速已经达到100英里了。
And you're already
doing 100 mph
all the way up.

961
00:54:13,180 --> 00:54:15,780
他帮我搞明白了
这游戏在哪些地方忠实还原了现实，
He helped me to understand
where the game
was true to life,

962
00:54:15,820 --> 00:54:17,940
又在哪些地方
把我彻底带沟里去了。
and where
it was leading me astray.

963
00:54:17,980 --> 00:54:20,620
那么，现在是时候
再试一把了。
So, then it was time
to try again.

964
00:54:28,940 --> 00:54:31,980
这是最要命的，
绝对是最让人抓狂的一段。
This is the worst.
That is the
absolute worst bit.

965
00:54:32,020 --> 00:54:34,140
游戏里你大拇指按死不放就行，
直接“呜——”就冲过去了。
You just keep your thumb on it
in the game.
You just, "Buuu."

966
00:54:36,380 --> 00:54:38,660
这里你只需要轻轻点一下……
This is where you just
dab the...

967
00:54:38,700 --> 00:54:40,620
我就是下不去脚啊！
I just can't do it.

968
00:54:42,220 --> 00:54:43,660
[哔——]
[BLEEP]

969
00:54:46,460 --> 00:54:51,940
你在PlayStation上可体会不到这个，
那种肾上腺素狂飙的感觉。
You don't get that in a
PlayStation,
that surge of adrenaline.

970
00:54:51,980 --> 00:54:57,060
这次我打算拿出在游戏里那股狠劲，
狠狠切入“开瓶器弯”。
This time I tried to attack
The Corkscrew with the venom
I used in the game.

971
00:54:57,100 --> 00:54:58,540
别刹车，别刹车，
千万别刹！
Don't brake, don't brake,
don't brake.

972
00:54:58,580 --> 00:55:00,220
但根本没用。
But it was hopeless.

973
00:55:00,260 --> 00:55:04,180
我的右腿完全不听使唤，
它自己踩下去了！
My leg's got a mind of its own
and it's braking!

974
00:55:04,220 --> 00:55:06,740
现实实在太特么吓人了。
The reality was
just too daunting.

975
00:55:13,180 --> 00:55:16,580
差距太大了，游戏里你根本感受不到
现实中承受的这种G值……
So much, and you don't feel
that G-force that you get...

976
00:55:18,380 --> 00:55:20,460
我打方向太早了！
