It's that part of your brain
that makes you frightened.

1001
00:56:49,860 --> 00:56:52,940
这就是职业赛车手没有的东西。
That's what racing drivers
don't have.

1002
00:56:52,980 --> 00:56:56,380
他们根本没有想象力，
他们才不会去琢磨：
They don't have imagination.
They're not thinking,

1003
00:56:56,420 --> 00:56:59,900
“要是车轮现在飞出去了
